{"ID":"20260625032342-cotgunk","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260625032342-cotgunk","title":"音效需求","type":"doc","updated":"20260626181517"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260625032342-r0bui10","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260625032342-r0bui10","updated":"20260626181517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音乐"}]},{"ID":"20260626173752-ewx4nd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626173752-ewx4nd5","updated":"20260626181205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数首恐怖惊悚悬疑风格的长短不一，又不是很热门的可用曲子，拿来做BGM备用库。"}]},{"ID":"20260626172833-h2o8z6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626172833-h2o8z6l","updated":"20260626181059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一段用于最后追逐对抗战的曲子，我希望它同时有一定的节奏感、焦虑感、冷漠疏离、略微悲伤的感觉。我是希望能在后朋克风格里面找找有没有这种感觉的曲子。"}]},{"ID":"20260626181207-3yxnuzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626181207-3yxnuzv","updated":"20260626181517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面的两次反转找找有没有合适的那种让人后背发凉的短音乐，可以参考《潜伏1》结尾男主角在阴间喊“no”时的音效，以及打泥泥2022-5-13视频结尾、2020-4-28视频结尾的音效（其实基本上他每个悬疑细思极恐风视频的结尾音乐基本都可以用或者参考一下feel，他在和配乐配合这方面太轻车熟路了）"}]},{"ID":"20260626172823-z5ha2jd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260626172823-z5ha2jd","updated":"20260626181201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"音效"}]},{"ID":"20260626175038-1rfg306","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175038-1rfg306","updated":"20260626174615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"老游戏那种“叮”的切换或选择提示音"}]},{"ID":"20260626175038-zw6tnai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175038-zw6tnai","updated":"20260626174027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"键盘或其他按钮按下声"}]},{"ID":"20260626175038-5ibru20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175038-5ibru20","updated":"20260626174040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"键盘或其他按钮抬起声"}]},{"ID":"20260626174249-dsgs7ps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174249-dsgs7ps","updated":"20260626174350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非常核心的拍门声，要两个版本，一个是正常清脆的版本，一个是像是隔着耳机听到现实里拍门声的发闷版本，两者可以都多找几个版本，轻重节奏不同的，拍的次数不同的，备用"}]},{"ID":"20260626174517-3qhrurb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174517-3qhrurb","updated":"20260626174525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相对正常的敲门声"}]},{"ID":"20260626174650-3jdcris","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174650-3jdcris","updated":"20260626174710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"扭门把手开门声"}]},{"ID":"20260626174718-zl8fcm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174718-zl8fcm5","updated":"20260626174732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木头的“吱呀”声"}]},{"ID":"20260626174743-848uk3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174743-848uk3e","updated":"20260626174801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在木地板上的走路声（清脆一些）"}]},{"ID":"20260626174801-kcz4eyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174801-kcz4eyg","updated":"20260626174950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在较硬地面上的走步声"}]},{"ID":"20260626174041-w46h6oz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626174041-w46h6oz","updated":"20260626175046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铁餐盘掉地上的声音"}]},{"ID":"20260626175046-03v96je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175046-03v96je","updated":"20260626175233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"房门“吱呀”慢慢打开的声"}]},{"ID":"20260626175233-6i1y9xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175233-6i1y9xw","updated":"20260626175245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"钢水杯掉地上以及在地上滚动的声"}]},{"ID":"20260626175245-g28fegk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175245-g28fegk","updated":"20260626175247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"风声"}]},{"ID":"20260626180656-qzqbfcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626180656-qzqbfcy","updated":"20260626180657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在餐桌前生气拍桌子的声音"}]},{"ID":"20260626175247-5fu0vi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175247-5fu0vi7","updated":"20260626175328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小摆钟的“咔擦，咔擦”声"}]},{"ID":"20260626175457-wb8h5db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626175457-wb8h5db","updated":"20260626180306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大门被锁住开不开的声音（锁链摇晃声）"}]},{"ID":"20260626181018-k0uu5ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626181018-k0uu5ls","updated":"20260626181035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"跳跃后从大约50cm高的高度落到地面上的落地声"}]},{"ID":"20260626180308-fem4hjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626180308-fem4hjv","updated":"20260626180740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鬼恐惧又愤怒的吼叫声"}]},{"ID":"20260626180742-y9j15dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626180742-y9j15dq","updated":"20260626180749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开枪声"}]},{"ID":"20260626180749-c8w35mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626180749-c8w35mg","updated":"20260626180827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触电声（让触电者兹拉兹拉冒烟那种感觉）"}]},{"ID":"20260626181108-c93cqg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260626181108-c93cqg5","updated":"20260626181201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那种非常典型的惊悚悬疑惊吓音效（噔~），多找几个备用"}]}]}